{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/aboutthegame.png?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monday Syndrome is a singleplayer action roguelike where you play as an intern that's trapped in a hellish office.\u00a0Descend into a satirical corporate hell, battling demonic coworkers with absurd office supply weapons in an endless, procedurally generated tower. Can you survive the eternal 9-to-5?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/fastpacedaction_banner.png?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/fastpacedaction.gif?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash fast-paced, chaotic combat amidst destructible office environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/craftsystem_banner.png?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/craftsystem.gif?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine mundane office supplies to craft absurdly deadly tools of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/exeorders_banner.png?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/executiveorders.gif?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endure intrusive Executive Orders, powerful boons with chaotic distruptions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/professions_banner.png?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/skills.gif?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Select your profession and work towards being the best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/disclaimer.png?t=1743675544\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playtesters said &quot;damn this game is so addictive I can't stop playing&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monday Syndrome is a game that's evolving through the development. That's the reason trailer doesn't match these gifs. The gifs are the up-to-date look. I'll update the trailer soon\u2122</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3305970?t=1743675544","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743675544","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/4a5a90e08483bea0b3a5450ac839284e9ab56c6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743675544","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/4a5a90e08483bea0b3a5450ac839284e9ab56c6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743675544","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_supp